amol","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3726-7a28-ae1f-703b9bf278d7","description":"Morphine","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3726-7afc-b8d7-3a9649386a04","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What is Hepatology the study of?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Hepatology focuses on the liver, which also helps filter waste products from the blood.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3726-775f-a27b-65e4afb15f7c","description":"The liver","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3726-7211-a326-c70de7b29355","description":"Religion","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3726-718c-bb55-021e3a277558","description":"The moon","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3726-75b4-baaf-ca0fd68264a5","description":"The number 7","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3726-70f7-950d-3a9da7b8fc68","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What is Oology the study of?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Oology is a branch of ornithology focused on bird eggs, including their shells, shape, and markings.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3726-7ee5-99dd-77490972a23f","description":"eggs","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3726-70e7-9df5-c5be25240e24","description":"organic particles, such as bacteria, fungal spores, very small insects and pollen","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3726-7f9b-b57c-7f50cc7ff662","description":"genetic differences in relation to the environment","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3726-791a-840b-f026e3aa976e","description":"the structure of cells","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3726-7db1-a89f-76bcc21b1890","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"Which ancient Greek scholar calculated the circumference of the Earth around 240 BC?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Eratosthenes compared the Sun\'s angle at Alexandria with its nearly overhead position at Syene, then used the distance between the cities to estimate Eart