ffected by a lobotomy?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"The frontal lobe contains the prefrontal cortex, which supports planning and judgment. Lobotomies disrupted its connections and could cause major changes in personality and behavior.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3727-771a-b039-2c10ab557a81","description":"Frontal lobe","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3727-741e-b3d1-9d5a60e63ab4","description":"Temporal lobe","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3727-717c-a3bf-0d6dc8e09633","description":"Occipital lobe","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3727-77a9-abc4-542a954f05b1","description":"Cerebellum","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3727-73a8-8c7d-95d4a941b37f","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"Which soft, purplish organ filters blood and stores platelets?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"The spleen also supports immune defenses and removes aging red blood cells from circulation.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3727-79a0-8e68-4c5ba82bfb37","description":"Spleen","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3727-7211-9335-b2d193c43741","description":"Pancreas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3727-7cdd-a686-7952da155e31","description":"Gallbladder","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3727-7855-9b7a-856f036b4fea","description":"Appendix","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218f9-3727-7570-aa1f-96a0d677e745","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"The \"canebrake\", \"timber\" and \"pygmy\" are types of what\"?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A rattlesnake\'s rattle is made of interlocking segments of keratin that vibrate when the tail shakes.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218f9-3727-760e-a4a6-2da04c09f3f6","description":"Rattlesnake","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218f9-3727-7d16-a97e-6b55a8550cdd","description":"Coyote","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3727-7823-8a22-e14d1390d576","description":"Goose","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218f9-3727-76ec-8